OL,3,GNEWSAUS embassy child abuse images
OL,4,Asuspect flown from UK before police
OL,5,Ainterview
OL,6,
OL,7,FA US embassy staffer accused of
OL,8,Fpossessing indecent images of children,
OL,9,Fwas detained at his south London flat
OL,10,Fand flown out of the UK in August,
OL,11,Fwithout being first questioned by
OL,12,FBritish police.
OL,14,FThe US Embassy confirmed to the BBC
OL,15,Fthat authorities are investigating the
OL,16,Fallegations and they have reassigned
OL,17,Fthe staff member to the US while
OL,18,Finquiries continue.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
