OL,3,GNEWSAUS embassy child abuse images
OL,4,Asuspect flown from UK before police
OL,5,Ainterview
OL,6,
OL,7,F"The United States government expects
OL,8,Fall personnel to adhere to the highest
OL,9,Fstandards of conduct, and we take these
OL,10,Fallegations seriously," embassy
OL,11,Fofficials said in a statement.
OL,13,FThey added that they "quickly informed
OL,14,FUK law enforcement and took swift
OL,15,Faction."
